OL,3,GNEWSADad sees son fall to death from
OL,4,ACyprus hotel window
OL,5,
OL,6,FA two-year-old boy fell to his death at
OL,7,Fa five-star hotel in Cyprus after his
OL,8,Ffather placed him on a windowsill, not
OL,9,Frealising it was open, a court has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FJoshua Foster, an auditor from Essex,
OL,13,F"lost control" of the toddler while
OL,14,Fshowing him the view of a water park,
OL,15,FPaphos District Court was told.
OL,17,FThe boy fell nearly 40ft (12.1m) from
OL,18,Fthe fourth floor of the King Evelthon
OL,19,FBeach Hotel and Resort in Chlorakas on
OL,20,F12 July, the first day of the family's
OL,21,Fholiday.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
