OL,3,GNEWSADad sees son fall to death from
OL,4,ACyprus hotel window
OL,5,
OL,6,FFoster, 37, previously pleaded guilty
OL,7,Fto causing death through a reckless,
OL,8,Frash or dangerous act and will be
OL,9,Fsentenced on 16 October.
